      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "This Interlocutory Application under Section 430 of the BNSS, 2023, is filed praying for suspension of conviction and sentence dated 10.05.2024, passed by the learned Additional Sessions Judge (FTC) No.4, Kamrup (M) in Sessions Case No.75/2016, whereby the appellant has been convicted and sentenced to Page No.# 3/3 undergo R.I. for seven (7) years and fine of Rs.10,000/-, under Section 376 of the IPC, and in default of fine, further S.I. for six (6) months.\nIssue notice to the respondent No.2, through registered post with A/D as well as by usual process.\nList the matter after three (3) weeks.\nJUDGE",
